# FastAPI Async Ratelimit

An asynchronous rate-limiting library for FastAPI applications.

## Installation

```bash
pip install fastapi-async-ratelimit


## Quick Start

from fastapi import FastAPI
from FastAPI_Async_Ratelimit import RateLimiter

app = FastAPI()

@app.get("/")
async def root():
    return {"message": "Hello World"}

